      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-12-28T13:19:10.010Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Presumably this is the Christmas episode we would have gotten last week if not for the unmovable feast of Pi Day.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c\" title=\"Screenshot_20211228-071139\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20211228-071139\" data-base62-sha1=\"nE7gwLNzJ3jtDp4CbOYN7WTLFyQ\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a5baecae375ee3fdcb2ed41c6b7968deb0a7650c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20211228-071139</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 104 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>That feel when your team is so outrageously powerful that you wish the villain had more HP.  Everyone but Argent ran out of cards because of a Divine Focus, Guise copying same, and Rebel Yell playing out Legacy’s whole kit; Helena engaged in her usual brinkmanship, and then died when I miscalculated around Tyler Hayes, but those were the only two downsides.</p>\n<p>Kismet was clobbered ridiculously fast because of Legacy and Fanatic, and Guise bought everybody three presents and then insisted that we not finish Kizzy off until he got to unwrap everything.  Unfortunately, I forgot his Two Left Feet jinx, so when he played Total Beefcake and stumbled over his own sex appeal, the barely-conscious Gabrielle plumb fainted away, like a schoolmarm with a touch of the vapors.  So Guise never got to find out what he bought himself for Christmas; hopefully the time portal will bring him back to December 24 and he can try it again.</p>",
