      "created_at": "2021-12-28T13:27:02.043Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is just a fun excuse to pile up presents and unwrap them out of turn for massive damage. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Not a hard fight at all. I made it last longer than necessary by forgetting I had picked Fanatic with Argent’s power specifically so she could play Wrathful Retribution and then not doing that. &lt;.&lt;</p>",
